{
  "id": "1CO.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Bakolinto 15",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 54,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būjūūko bo ng'wa Kilisito",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we bang'wise, leki namulanje ī mihayo ya Ng'hūlū Jawiza ījo nakamulomeela ng'ūjanukūla, na ng'wīmīīlile mujo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo ūyo nakamulomeela gwenūyo, gūlī gwa kūmupīja ūlū ng'ūgūdima mu welwa ng'holò, numho hamo mubize ng'wazunyaga higūlya gūlya dūhū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mu mihayo mitaale īyo nanukūla ū nene, h'īyo nakandya ū kūng'winha na a bing'we; gīkī ū Kilisito akacha kūlwa shibi shise gīt'ūmo shandīkwa shihayīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na gīkī akajīkwa, na gīkī ha lūshikū lo kadatū lwaho ūjūūka gīt'ūmo shandīkwa shihayīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na gīkī akang'wilongela Kefa, hūna na a babo ikūmi na babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha numa ya henaho, ūbilongela na badūgū bakīlile ha magana atanò ng'wikanza līmò. Bamò babo bataalī balīho nī lelo īyī, alīyo a bangī bamala kūlaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ūng'wilongela Yakobo, hūna na a batūng'wa a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose nū nene ūnilongela, nūbiza wa kūmalīja wabo, gītī nalī ndebile mu kūbyalwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū nene nalī ndo wa bado ū mu batūng'wa; nīyo natigeleelilwe nūūlū kwitanwa ntūng'wa, nguno nīluhyaga no ī kanisa ya ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo kūlwa shigongo sha ng'wa Mulungu nalī gīt'ūmo nalī, hama ī shigongo shakwe ū kūlī nene shitagelelile kūcha mpandagīlo. Nakūtūmamaga kūbatinda pye, gwike nahene natī nene; alīyo shigongo sha ng'wa Mulungu īsho shilī hamò na nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū nūūlū nabize nene nūūlū boi, h'ūmo tūkūlomeelelaga; hama h'ī nguno yene mulī bazunya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būjūūko wa bafu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī lūūlū, īkī ū Kilisito akūlomeelagwa gīkī wajūūka kūfuma mu bafu, nibūlī balīho bamò bing'we bakūhayaga būtīho ū būjūūko wa bafu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū būtīho ū būjūūko wa bafu, numho nū Kilisito atajūūkile! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū Kilisito ūlū atajūūkile, numho nū būlomeeji wise būtī na solobo, hū kūhaya muzunije dalali dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama na a bise numho tukūbiza giti bakaanīji balomolomo ba ng'wa Mulungu; īkī tūkūnkaanīlaga gīkī akanjūūcha ū Kilisito, ūyo gashi nīyo atanjūūkije, ūlū babize batūjūūchiagwa a bafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū batūjūūchiagwa a bafu, numho nū Kilisito atajūūchiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū Kilisito ūlū atajūūchiwe, būtī na solobo ū būzunya wing'we, hū kūhaya mutaalī mo dūhū ū mu shibi shing'we! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Numho nīyo na a babo bakūchīlaga mulī Kilisito bakūjimīīlaga dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū gīkī ū kwisagīlwa kwise ū mulī Kilisito kūgelelile mu būpanga ūbū dūhū, numho a bise hū tūlī ba kūpīnīhalīlwa kūtinda pye a banhū!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ū Kilisito wajūūka ng'hana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī haha, ū gwa ng'hana gūlī gīkī, ū Kilisito wamala kūjūūka kūfuma ū mu bafu, alī Itwajo lya kwandya mu bose abo balaalile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno gīt'ūmo kūcha kūkilonga mu nzīla ya ng'wa munhū ūmò, nū būjūūko wa bafu būlīho kūlwa nzīla ya ng'wa Munhū ūmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī gīt'ūmo mulī Adamu pye a banhū bakachaaga, h'ūmo īlī nū mulī Kilisito; pye bakwītwa kūbiza bapanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo būlī ng'wene mu kwihela kwakwe; wa kwandya Kilisito, hama a ba ng'wa Kilisito ūlū washoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūlū ūmala ū kūgakenaagūla pye a mabūsugi na a mabūtaale, na a mabūdūla, ū mhayo gwa kūmalīja gūkūbiza kūbūtūūla ū būsugi kūlī Mulungu Sīswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno shiigelile asuge kūshisha pye a banishi bakwe abatūūle ha sīlīlī ya mhambala jakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wanishi wa kūmalīja kūkenaagūlwa ng'wene kūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mhayo gūhayile gīkī, “Pyī ī shikolo ashitūūlile ha sīlīlī ya mhambala jakwe.” Alīyo ū mu kūhaya gīkī, “Pyī ī shikolo shitūūlilwe ha sīlīlī yakwe,” īlī hape gīkī ūyo antūūlīlile shikolo shose ha sīlīlī yakwe atī ūmò washo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ūlū shamala kūtūūlwa pyī ī shose ha sīlīlī yakwe, ū Ng'wana nang'hwe akūbiza ha sīlīlī yakwe ūyo antūūlīlile shikolo shose ha sīlīlī yakwe, gīkī ū Mulungu abize atang'anhīlile mu shose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ītī chene numho īkūja ginehe ī mihayo ya banhū abo bakabatīījiagwa kūlwa nguno ya bafu? Ūlū batūjūūchiagwa a bafu, nibūlī būbize ho būbatīījiwa kūlwa nguno yabo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bise nibūlī tūlī mu nhabaala ya kūcha būlī ikanza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badūgū bane, ū nene nakūchaaga būlī shikū nguno ya wikumīlīja, ūbo nalī nabo mulī Kilisito Yesu Seeba wise kūlwa nguno ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī, ūlū nakoiagwa būmunhū bone dūhū aho nalwaga na shiinū ja mu Efeso, numho nalī na solobo kī? A bafu ūlū batūjūūchiagwa, “Tūlyagi na tūng'wagi dūhū lūūlū, nguno ī ntondo tūkūcha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we, yaya ū kūlemva lemva; a kashimīzīle kabūbi kakakenaagūlaga nhūngwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilang'hanagi mushimīzīle mu būtūngīlīja, hama yaya ū kwīta ī shibi; nguno balīho bangī bataamanile ū Mulungu. Ū gwenūyū nalīmuwīla namudimye minala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mīlī gwa būjūūko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūngī ashikile kūbūja gīkī, “A bafu bakūjūūchiwa ginehe? Na hangī bakwiza mu mīlī kī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wenūbo būbbūūlī! Nguno nūūlū ī mbīyū īyo ūkīhambaga ītabizaga mhanga kūshisha īche tame! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nīyo īsho ūkahambaga ūtahambaga mīlī ūyo gūlabize ho, ūkahambaga mbeke dūhū; hamo ya būsīga, nūūlū ya shikolo shingī nasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Mulungu akayinhaga mīlī gīt'ūmo atogelilwe wei ng'wenekīlī, nīyo būlī mbīyū na mīlī gwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mibīlī ī yose ītī ya mbika īmò, īlīho ya banhū, yīngī ya ndimu, yīngī ya noni, na yīngī ya ndīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlīho na mibīlī ya ng'wigūlū, na mibīlī ya mu sī. Alīyo ī likūjo lya mibīlī ya ng'wigūlū līlī kīngī, nī likūjo lya mibīlī ya mu sī nalyo līlī kīngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likūjo lya līīmi līlī heeke, nī likūjo lya ng'weji līlī heeke, nī lya sonda nalyo līlī heeke; nguno nūūlū ī sonda na sonda dūhū jikīla kīlile ī likūjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo būlī nū būjūūko wa bafu, ū mīlī ūyo gūkahambagwa gūlī gwa kūkenaagūka, ūyo gūkūjūūchiwa gūtī gwa kūkenaagūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gūkahambagwa mu būdalahwa, gūkūjūūchiwa ng'wikūjo; gūkahambagwa mu būgokolo, gūkūjūūchiwa mu būdūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo gūkajīkagwa gūlī mīlī dūhū, alīyo gūkūjūūchiwa mīlī gwa Kiimoyo; ūlū gūlīho ū mīlī gwa nyama, nū mīlī gwa Kiimoyo gūlīho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo gwandīkilwe nīyo; gīkī, “Ū munhū wa kwandya ū Adamu, akabiza mpanga.” Ū Adamu wa kūmalīja ng'wene alī Moyo, ng'winhi wa būpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū wa Kiimoyo walī atī wa kwandya, alīyo ū wa mīlī gwa nyama; hūna wiza nū wa Kiimoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū wa kwandya afumile mu sī, wa malongo; ū Munhū wa kabīlī ng'wene afumile ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmo alī ū wa mu sī, h'ūmo balī a ba mu sī, nū mumo alī ū wa ng'wigūlū, h'ūmo balī a ba ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ūmo twīsolela ī suso yakwe ū munhū wa mu sī, h'ūmo tūkwīsolela nī suso yakwe ū wa ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo ūyo nalīgūhaya bang'wise gūlī gīkī, ū mīlī na a mininga shitūdūla ū kūbiza na wingīji ū mu būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu, nūūlū ū būkenaagūku būtūdūla ū kūbiza na wingīji hamò na būtūkenaagūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leki namugodele kaka kamhayo ka mbisīla, gīkī, tūtūshila kūcha pye a bose, alīyo pyī tūkūgalūchiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūbiza ng'wikanza iguhī gītī lya kūgabbya ngohe, h'ikanza ly'ipembe lya kūmalīja. Nguno ipembe līkūlīla, hūna a bafu bakūhimbukila mu būtūkenaagūka, a bise nise tūkūgalūchiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mīlī gwa kūkenaagūka gwenūyū shiigelile gūzwale būtūkenaagūka, ū gwa kūcha gwenūyū gūzwale būtūūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū mīlī gwa kūkenaagūka gwenūyū ūlū gūzwala būtūkenaagūka, ū gwa kūcha gwenūyū gūbiza gwazwala būtūcha, a henaho gūkūbiza gwashikīīla ū mhayo ūyo gwandīkilwe gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
